problems.statement:
Consider a \((2m-1) \times (2n-1)\) rectangular region, where \(m\) and \(n\) are integers such that \(m, n \geq 4\). This region is to be tiled using tiles of the two types shown:
\[
\setlength{\unitlength}{4144sp}

